# Public surface allowlist for karma-play.
# docs/, tools/, lab/ and scripts/ are deliberately absent: deployment notes,
# build tools and the art and physics labs do not belong on a site for toddlers.
# voice/ (the v1 clips) stays published and untouched: it is cached immutable for
# a year and old installs may still ask for it. The game itself uses voice2/.

